WEBVTT

00:15:29.829 --> 00:15:31.829
We still have a lot of hard
engineering work to do,

00:15:31.829 --> 00:15:34.079
but I'm pretty confident we're
going to be able to.

00:15:34.329 --> 00:15:37.454
And now the questions are like,
what should we build?

00:15:38.454 --> 00:15:41.621
And how and why and what
data should we train on

00:15:41.871 --> 00:15:45.912
and how do we build systems not just that
can do these like phenomenally impressive

00:15:45.912 --> 00:15:48.954
things, but that we can ensure
do the things that we want

00:15:49.204 --> 00:15:54.162
and that understand the concepts of
truth and falsehood and, you know,

00:15:54.371 --> 00:15:57.996
alignment with human values and
misalignment with human values.

00:15:59.329 --> 00:16:02.746
One of the pieces of research that
we put out last year that